---
title: "member_profile_view (Clubhouse Manager)"
---
stateDiagram-v2
    direction TB
    [*] --> q_auth: check authenticated session
    q_auth --> q_error: session invalid
    q_auth --> q_fetch: session valid
    q_fetch --> q_resolve: determine target profile ID
    q_resolve --> q_query: query member by ID from DB
    q_query --> q_not_found: member not found or logically deleted
    q_query --> q_render: member found
    q_render --> [*]: return profile data (status, generation, student_number, discord_info)
    q_not_found --> [*]: return not found error
    q_error --> [*]: return unauthorized error

    note right of q_resolve
        INV-001: Users can view any non-deleted member profile
        INV-002: Logically deleted members must not be returned
    end note
